    "The four ordinary-binary n47 m=4 receipts retain two F6 pair domains and two bounded enumeration traces across both twists; the twisted enumeration timeout is censored. None independently recovered a scalar, and scoped PMU observations are not whole-worker instruction labels.",
    "The 26 Koblitz n23 enumeration receipts span m=3..15 on both twists with one fixed public core per twist. The four m=3,4 cells completed their fixed factor-base search without decomposition; the 22 m=5..15 cells are timeout-censored. No cell independently recovered a scalar, and no whole-worker instruction-to-solve label was verified.",
    "The 26 ordinary-binary n23 enumeration receipts span m=3..15 on both twists with one fixed public core per twist. Six m=3..5 native searches finished as verified method outcomes; twenty m=6..15 searches stopped at the fixed work budget. All 26 cells completed verification and strict export, including the budget-limited outcomes. No new cell independently recovered a scalar, and no whole-worker instruction-to-solve label was verified."
